 brain regions  resulting in greater creativity  goal-oriented behavior and even  efficient brain processes as you can see  then meditation is a powerful tool for  becoming a badass whether you want to  overcome the fear of your own death gain  superhuman focus or crack the secrets of  the universe meditation is one of the  best tools for training and reshaping  your gray matter your brain has the  ability to uncover secrets of the  universe whilst you're sat on the bog  it's just an amazing tool that many of  us just don't take full advantage of  meditation is like a workout for your  brain and I don't understand why more  people aren't doing this essentially  meditation is the intentional inward  direction of attention or lack thereof  it simply means using your focus and  control to flex specific brain areas or  to enter specific brain States and that  makes you better at using them through  brain plasticity you might even enlarge  those areas over time what you achieve  with this is determined only by the  brain regions you choose to work out so  my underlying hypothesis is instead of  focusing only on relaxing the mind and  entering a parasympathetic mindful state  we should combine this with other forms  of meditation being mindful and in the  now is great but it's not a kind of  silver bullet it's not all projective ly  superior to any other brain state not a  few value creativity forwards planning  or even a little bit of motivating you  stress a healthy brain has abilities to  jump between brain states as needed by  the environment we should practice  different forms of meditation and  combine them just as we wouldn't focus  purely on one muscle group in the gym  and I've not even scratched the surface  of some other forms of meditation or  meditative like practices what about  using meditation to enter a lucid dream  state for instance which I'll be talking  about soon or to enhance a visual acuity  there's a whole lot more to it than  simply chanting and 